PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids in Crowley County came in under 90% of normal in 40 of 75 years for January to February, April to May and November to December, and in 32 of 75 years for June to July and July to August. In 2025, October to November came in at 45% of normal on the middle. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 43% and April to May at 54% on the middle. Grid 21706 had its driest year in 2002 at 36% of normal.</p>"}
